        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: deep grayish cream colored linen. Design: large scale all-over closely spaced continuous scrolling thorny stems; in each tightly curved scroll a blossom (12 different various types curl out from scrolling stems. Worked with soft polychrome silks, in satin, chain, modified ermine stich, and couching stitches. Parts of so-called \"Long Cover\""@en ;
